ctrl-D:
• In interactive mode:
	exit.
• In heredocs:
	returns to terminal (warning: here-document at line 10 delimited by end-of-file (wanted `.'))
• In && || read more cmds:
	exit (bash: syntax error: unexpected end of file)
• In cat (stdin):
	returns to terminal

